{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SpectralCollapseCriteria"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.nonempty_pagedSS_concentrated","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.nonempty_pagedSS_concentrated","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L154-L174","doc":"**The page family is inhabitable.**\n\nWitnessed by the zero differential, whose page-turning isomorphism is the identity\ncomposite `E_{r+1} ≅ ker 0 ⧸ im 0 = ⊤ ⧸ ⊥`.\n\nThe witness is *not* what makes `concentrated_collapses` true — that theorem\nquantifies over every `S` and never inspects `S.d`.  This only rules out the reading\nunder which the results above are about an empty type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.gbCollapsesOfConcentrated","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.gbCollapsesOfConcentrated","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L131-L139","doc":"**The discharge, from a real page family.**\n\n`legacyOfPaged` has existed since 2026-08-24 and had no argument to be applied to.\nThis is the first `GBFiltrationCollapsesAtE2` in the corpus whose witness is neither\n`PUnit` nor an assumption: the pages are `M` on the surviving column, and the\ncollapse is derived from the support rather than built into the model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.concentrated_collapses","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.concentrated_collapses","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L115-L129","doc":"**Concentration forces collapse at E₂.**\n\nFor *every* differential this page family admits — the statement quantifies over\n`S`, and its proof never looks at `S.d`.  The `r = 0` and `r = 1` differentials are\nunconstrained; collapse asks only about `r ≥ 2`, and there the shift `p ↦ p + r`\nalready leaves the window.\n\nThis is Step 1 of `conj:phi-q-categorical-truncation` turned from an assertion into\na consequence of the concentration that step states. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.columnEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.columnEquiv","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L105-L113","doc":"**The `p = 0` column is genuinely `M`.**\n\nRecorded so that the family cannot be mistaken for a dressed-up `PUnit`: the\nsurviving column is the whole module — `Z(A)` in the intended reading — not a\nplaceholder. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.subsingleton_of_p_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.subsingleton_of_p_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L95-L103","doc":"Off the `p = 0` column the page is the zero module.\n\nThis is the only property of the family the collapse argument uses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.instModuleConcentratedPage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.instModuleConcentratedPage","kind":"instance","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L90-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.instAddCommGroupConcentratedPage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.instAddCommGroupConcentratedPage","kind":"instance","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L85-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.ConcentratedPage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ConcentratedColumnCollapse.ConcentratedPage","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ConcentratedColumnCollapse.lean#L75-L83","doc":"**Pages concentrated in the `p = 0` column**: the module `M` there, the zero\nmodule everywhere else.\n\nCarried as a `Submodule`-valued family rather than an `if … then M else PUnit`, so\nthat the `AddCommGroup` and `Module R` instances are the *uniform* submodule ones.\nThe `if` version needs an instance defined by case split, and the two splits then\nhave to agree definitionally for every lemma that mentions both. ","signatureChunk":0}]}